                  <items count="4">
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Display geometry in ShapeDiver's viewer using glTF 2.0 materials.

Change the nickname of this component to create a named output, which can be used in ShapeDiver's Viewer API.</item>
